Each hand-on above is answered at both ends in data/progressions/arts.csv (the Level 1 rows' `assumes` cells).
Level 1 is entered by level, not grade (STANDARD.md 3.2): a student new to media arts starts there, and its bridge
unit (at most 12 days) teaches the grade 8 techniques and words it needs as readiness, claiming no grade 8 id, so
nothing in Level 1 requires this course.

